{"title":"Here&#8217;s What Life Was Like Before the Affordable Care Act","link":"https://kottke.org/25/04/heres-what-life-was-like-before-the-affordable-care-act","date":1743523704000,"content":"\n        <p>From Aubrey Hirsch, <a href=\"https://aubreyhirsch.substack.com/p/it-could-be-much-much-worse\">It Could Be Much, Much Worse</a>, an illustrated guide to what health care and insurance was like in the US before the ACA.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/before-aca-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/before-aca-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/before-aca-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1350\" alt=\"Many plans excluded coverage for things like prescription drugs, lab work, and preventative care like vaccines and mammograms.\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/before-aca-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/before-aca-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/before-aca-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1350\" alt=\"Or, an insurance company could attach a rider to your plan laying out which conditions they would refuse to cover.\" /></p>\n\n<p>You can also find this guide <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DH5z0GNO4jd/\">on Instagram</a>.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Aubrey%20Hirsch\">Aubrey Hirsch</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/comics\">comics</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/healthcare\">healthcare</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/politics\">politics</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/04/heres-what-life-was-like-before-the-affordable-care-act\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"46654475462235973eb779191e99c7afeae9ff199ef71e9ab80f3001d79eb6b0","category":"Sites"}